ons**: Complete frontend task breakdown process unchanged\\n\\n## Next Steps\\nThe updated configuration is now active and will take effect for future Frontend Coordinator instantiations. The agent definition maintains all existing capabilities while using the requested \'sonnet\' model preference.\\n\\n## Comparison to Previous Work\\nThis continues the model optimization work that was already completed for the Test Coordinator agent. Both coordinators now use the \'sonnet\' model as requested."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01DXFyu2L9A14Kii2Lug6GBc', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'update_task', 'project_id': 'eb710ee5', 'task_id': '89fceca4', 'status': 'completed', 'note': 'Verified Frontend Coordinator model configuration was updated to sonnet. No further changes required.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01DXFyu2L9A14Kii2Lug6GBc', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Updated task status to completed"}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-3-5-haiku-20241022', 'system': "You are a Executive Director agent.\n\n## Purpose\n\n\n## Instructions\n\n\n## Input Format\nYour input will be provided in the following format:\n```json\n{}\n```\n\n## Output Format\nYou must respond with JSON matching this exact format:\n```json\n{}\n```\n\n## When to Request Clarification\nRequest clarification when:\n\n\n## Termination Conditions\nYou are done when:\n\n\nCRITICAL: Your response must be valid JSON matching the Output Format exactly.\n\n## Your Performance History\n- Success rate: 57.9%\n- Average iterations per task: 12.0\n- Common errors to avoid: CircuitBreakerOpenError, BadRequestError, RateLimitError\n\n**Tips for this run:**\n- Focus on completing tasks successfully - your success rate needs improvement.\n- Try to be more efficient - you're using more iterations than typical.\n- Watch out for these common errors: CircuitBreakerOpenError, BadRequestError\n\n**Learnings from