ons**: Complete frontend task breakdown process unchanged\\n\\n## Next Steps\\nThe updated configuration is now active and will take effect for future Frontend Coordinator instantiations. The agent definition maintains all existing capabilities while using the requested \'sonnet\' model preference.\\n\\n## Comparison to Previous Work\\nThis continues the model optimization work that was already completed for the Test Coordinator agent. Both coordinators now use the \'sonnet\' model as requested."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01DXFyu2L9A14Kii2Lug6GBc', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'update_task', 'project_id': 'eb710ee5', 'task_id': '89fceca4', 'status': 'completed', 'note': 'Verified Frontend Coordinator model configuration was updated to sonnet. No further changes required.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01DXFyu2L9A14Kii2Lug6GBc', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Updated task status to completed"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '{\n  "status": "in_progress", \n  "phase": "final_verification",\n  "findings": {\n    "model_configuration": {\n      "frontend_coordinator": {\n        "previous_model": "haiku",\n        "current_model": "sonnet",\n        "status": "verified_updated",\n        "file_location": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/coordinators/frontend_coordinator.md"\n      }\n    },\n    "configuration_update": {\n      "steps_completed": [\n        "Located agent definition file",\n        "Verified previous model was \'haiku\'", \n        "Updated model preference to \'sonnet\'",\n        "Created backup of original file"\n      ],\n      "impact_assessment": {\n        "performance_risk": "low",\n        "cost_benefit": "improved efficiency",\n        "functionality": "unchanged"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  "next_steps": [\n    "Confirm overall system-wide model configuration consistency",\n    "Final valid